{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"halign"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLeftCenterRight"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Words and music by Pat Songwriter","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Typically this type of credit is aligned to the right, so that the position information refers to the right-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"most part of the text. But in this example, the text is center-justified, not right-justified.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The halign attribute is used in these situations. If it is not present, its value is the same as for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"justify attribute. For elements where a justify attribute is not allowed, the default is implementation-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dependent.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"halign","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"halign"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"halign","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLPedalV6halignAA18MXLLeftCenterRightOSgvp","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/halign","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpedal\/halign"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where text extends over more than one line, horizontal alignment and justify values can be different."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The most typical case is for credits, such as:"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPedal/halign":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpedal\/halign","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/halign","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"halign","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLLeftCenterRight","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where text extends over more than one line, horizontal alignment and justify values can be different."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The most typical case is for credits, such as:"}],"title":"halign","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLLeftCenterRight":{"title":"MXLLeftCenterRight","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"MXLLeftCenterRight","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlleftcenterright","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLeftCenterRight","abstract":[{"text":"The left-center-right type is used to define horizontal alignment and text justification.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPedal":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The pedal type represents piano pedal marks, including damper and sostenuto pedal marks. The line attribute is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"yes if pedal lines are used. The sign attribute is yes if Ped, Sost, and * signs are used. For compatibility"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with older versions, the sign attribute is yes by default if the line attribute is no, and is no by default if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the line attribute is yes. If the sign attribute is set to yes and the type is start or sostenuto, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"abbreviated attribute is yes if the short P and S signs are used, and no if the full Ped and Sost signs are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used. It is no by default. Otherwise the abbreviated attribute is ignored. The alignment attributes are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored if the sign attribute is no."}],"title":"MXLPedal","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPedal","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLPedal","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpedal","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}